The exterior grading is the plain degree shifted by the degree of the pairing:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9749e14f-09e6-4194-ba67-0a4d8579e0c4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"pairing", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"GradedPairing", "[", 
